{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/17/1047324/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐりんぐりんまきまき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふほー\nみなさん心配おかけしてすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も稽古でした！\n明日も！明日は朝お仕事もあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お稽古は毎回勉強になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今日はね、\n目がきらきらして\n食いつくように見ていたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい気持ちも見えた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい。やっぱりすごいなあ。\nいいな、いいなあ。\n素敵なものができるといいなあ。\n心から楽しむんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあああああああ\n治れーはよ治れー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/17/1047324/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご、いちご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}